description:
Plate Thermo–Shakers are designed for shaking and thermostating 4 standard 96–well microplates.

A multisystem principle, used in design of the Thermo–Shaker, allows operating it as 3 independent devices:


	Incubator;
	Microplate shaker;
	Thermo–Shaker.


